p: usize,\n    data: *mut Shared,\n}","attr_info":{"attributes":[{"DocComment":" A unique reference to a contiguous slice of memory."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" `BytesMut` represents a unique view into a potentially shared memory region."},{"DocComment":" Given the uniqueness guarantee, owners of `BytesMut` handles are able to"},{"DocComment":" mutate the memory."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" `BytesMut` can be thought of as containing a `buf: Arc<Vec<u8>>`, an offset"},{"DocComment":" into `buf`, a slice length, and a guarantee that no other `BytesMut` for the"},{"DocComment":" same `buf` overlaps with its slice. That guarantee means that a write lock"},{"DocComment":" is not required."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" # Growth"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" `BytesMut`'s `BufMut` implementation will implicitly grow its buffer as"},{"DocComment":" necessary. However, explicitly reserving the required space up-front before"},{"DocComment":" a series of inserts will be more efficient."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" # Examples"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" ```"},{"DocComment":" use bytes::{BytesMut, BufMut};"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" let mut buf = BytesMut::with_capacity(64);"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" buf.put_u8(b'h');"},{"DocComment":" buf.put_u8(b'e');"},{"DocComment":" buf.put(&b\"llo\"[..]);"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" assert_eq!(&buf[..], b\"hello\");"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" // Freeze the buffer so that it can be shared"},{"DocComment":" let a = buf.freeze();"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" // This does not allocate, instead `b` points to the same memory."},{"DocComment":" let b = a.clone();"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" assert_eq!(&a[..], b\"hello\");"},{"DocComment":" assert_eq!(&b[..], b\"hello\");"},{"DocComment":" ```"}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":true,"started_from":false,"is_extern":false,"opacity":"Transparent","lang_item":null,"diagnostic_item":null